From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:22:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Rename PSR-Address to PPR-Address

3GPP TS 29.173 clause 6.4.9 defines AVP 2407 as PPR-Address, the address
of the Privacy Profile Register; table 6.4.1/1 and the RIA ABNF in
clause 6.2.4 agree. Checked against V18.0.0.

Renaming an AVP renames its display filter field (diameter.PSR-Address
becomes diameter.PPR-Address), so saved filters and profiles using the
old name need updating.
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..2fb5374 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -7171,7 +7171,7 @@
 				<gavp name="GMLC-Address"/>
 			</grouped>
 		</avp>
-		<avp name="PSR-Address" code="2407" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
+		<avp name="PPR-Address" code="2407" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="IPAddress"/>
 		</avp>
 		<avp name="MME-Realm" code="2408" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
